{"id":42971,"date":"2025-07-06T21:26:29","date_gmt":"2025-07-06T20:26:29","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/pisao-extreme-2026\/"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:35:05","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:35:05","slug":"pisao-extreme","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/pisao-extreme\/","title":{"rendered":"Pis\u00e3o Extreme 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Pis\u00e3o Extreme 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O m\u00edtico <strong>Pis\u00e3o Extreme 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>4 de outubro de 2026<\/strong>, na aldeia do <strong>Pis\u00e3o<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Viseu<\/strong>. Considerado unanimemente como uma das provas de Skyrunning mais duras, t\u00e9cnicas e verticais de Portugal e da Pen\u00ednsula Ib\u00e9rica, o evento desafia os atletas nos maci\u00e7os rochosos e encostas agrestes da <strong>Serra da Arada<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com organiza\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>SpotCriativo Eventos<\/strong> e sob a \u00e9gide da <strong>Federa\u00e7\u00e3o de Campismo e Montanhismo de Portugal (FCMP)<\/strong>, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o apresenta quatro desafios tit\u00e2nicos: o colossal <strong>PEX L (65 km com 6500m D+)<\/strong>, o <strong>PEX M (35 km com 3600m D+)<\/strong>, o <strong>PEX S (25 km com 2200m D+)<\/strong> e o <strong>PEX XS (16 km com 1000m D+)<\/strong>, exigindo total experi\u00eancia e destreza em alta montanha.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">4 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 06:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Aldeia do Pis\u00e3o, Serra da Arada, S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul, Viseu<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">65 km (6500m D+), 35 km (3600m D+), 25 km (2200m D+) e 16 km (1000m D+)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">SpotCriativo Eventos e Munic\u00edpio de S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Skyrunning<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Pis\u00e3o Extreme L (PEX L)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 4 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 06:30 \u2022 6500m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Skyrunning<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Pis\u00e3o Extreme M (PEX M)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 4 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:00 \u2022 3600m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Skyrunning<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Pis\u00e3o Extreme S (PEX S)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 4 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:30 \u2022 2200m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Skyrunning<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Pis\u00e3o Extreme XS (PEX XS)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 4 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00 \u2022 1000m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando se realiza o Pis\u00e3o Extreme 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no domingo, 4 de outubro de 2026, com partidas desfasadas a partir das 06h30 na Aldeia do Pis\u00e3o, S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e desn\u00edveis acumulados da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento integra 4 provas de skyrunning: PEX L (65 km e 6500m D+), PEX M (35 km e 3600m D+), PEX S (25 km e 2200m D+) e PEX XS (16 km e 1000m D+).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o grau de dificuldade t\u00e9cnica do Pis\u00e3o Extreme?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">\u00c9 classificada como de dificuldade extrema, com cristas rochosas expostas, declives de elevada inclina\u00e7\u00e3o e trilhos altamente t\u00e9cnicos na Serra da Arada.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Existe material obrigat\u00f3rio de seguran\u00e7a?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, dependendo da dist\u00e2ncia, \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio o uso de manta t\u00e9rmica, apito, luz frontal com baterias suplentes, corta-vento\/imperme\u00e1vel, telem\u00f3vel e reserva l\u00edquida m\u00ednima de 1 litro.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais e o regulamento completo est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis na plataforma Stop and Go (www.stopandgo.net) e no site oficial (www.pisaoextreme.pt).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Pis\u00e3o Extreme 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-04\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Aldeia do Pis\u00e3o, Serra da Arada, S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul\", \"addressRegion\": \"Viseu\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"SpotCriativo Eventos e Munic\u00edpio de S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando se realiza o Pis\u00e3o Extreme 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no domingo, 4 de outubro de 2026, com partidas desfasadas a partir das 06h30 na Aldeia do Pis\u00e3o, S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e desn\u00edveis acumulados da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento integra 4 provas de skyrunning: PEX L (65 km e 6500m D+), PEX M (35 km e 3600m D+), PEX S (25 km e 2200m D+) e PEX XS (16 km e 1000m D+).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o grau de dificuldade t\u00e9cnica do Pis\u00e3o Extreme?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"\u00c9 classificada como de dificuldade extrema, com cristas rochosas expostas, declives de elevada inclina\u00e7\u00e3o e trilhos altamente t\u00e9cnicos na Serra da Arada.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Existe material obrigat\u00f3rio de seguran\u00e7a?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, dependendo da dist\u00e2ncia, \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio o uso de manta t\u00e9rmica, apito, luz frontal com baterias suplentes, corta-vento\/imperme\u00e1vel, telem\u00f3vel e reserva l\u00edquida m\u00ednima de 1 litro.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais e o regulamento completo est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis na plataforma Stop and Go (www.stopandgo.net) e no site oficial (www.pisaoextreme.pt).\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66222,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[22,497,498,499],"event_type_2":[726,820,102],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-42971","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-sao-pedro-do-sul-viseu","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type-trail-ultra","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal","e